WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back and hug both knees into the chest for a breath or two.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Drop both knees to the right, stacking them roughly at hip height.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Stretch the arms wide and turn the head gently to the left, keeping both shoulders heavy.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Soften completely - let gravity do the twisting, not effort.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Draw the knees back to center and repeat on the other side.
